# Line-ending policy for the Tennis World monorepo. Without this file nothing
# normalizes EOLs, so a file edited on Windows is rewritten LF -> CRLF and its
# diff shows every line as changed — which buries the real change during review.
# Text is stored LF in the repository regardless of the checkout platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched by EOL conversion.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
